--- OLD
  @Begin:
    JSR ClearZeroPage               ; clear Zero Page for good measure
--- NEW
  @Begin:
    JSR ClearZeroPage               ; clear Zero Page for good measure

.import rando_ensure
    ;  The randomizer's world, built here from the save New Game just made or
    ;  Continue just loaded -- before any game code runs, so the build's
    ;  pause falls in the transition into the game rather than on the first
    ;  step, battle or menu that wants it.  After a soft reset WRAM, and so
    ;  the cache, is intact: this only compares the tag.  The consumers still
    ;  ensure, a check that should now never fire.
    JSL rando_ensure + RANDOFAR
